for Your Gym","text":"<p>Your members are already asking about CBD. Give them a product that actually delivers — fast-acting in as little as 10 minutes, with 6x better absorption than anything oil-based. When customers feel real results, they come back. That's how you build a repeat revenue line at your front desk.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","color":"#001029"}},"why2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":false,"image_width":650,"title":"The Science That Sells Itself","text":"<p>Founded by former Johnson &amp; Johnson executives. SmartSorb™ technology. Peer-reviewed clinical trials. Third-party tested. THC-free. Your members do their research — NextEvo holds up. That credibility makes every conversation at your front desk easy, and every repeat purchase predictable.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","color":"#001029"}},"why3":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":false,"image_width":650,"title":"Economics That Work for You","text":"<p>50% retail margins. Low minimum order. No long-term commitment. We put hard cash in your pocket — not just product on your shelf. Every case you sell at MSRP returns $330 in gross profit. Easy to start, easy to scale, easy to reorder when it sells through.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","color":"#001029"}}},"block_order":["why1","why2","why3"],"name":"Why NextEvo","settings":{"title":"","align_text":"left","caption":"below","divider":false}},"differentiators_wl3":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"diff_html_wl3":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<style>\n.wl3-diff{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}\n.wl3-diff h2{font-size:clamp(20px,2.8vw,30px);font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;margin:0 0 28px;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;}\n.wl3-diff-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px 40px;}\n.wl3-diff-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:15px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);line-height:1.5;}\n.wl3-diff-list li strong{color:#efec9f;white-space:nowrap;}\n.wl3-diff-list li::before{content:'—';color:#efec9f;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}\n@media(max-width:580px){.wl3-diff-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"wl3-diff\">\n  <h2>The NextEvo Difference<\/h2>\n  <ul class=\"wl3-diff-list\">\n    <li><strong>6x absorption<\/strong> vs. oil-based CBD — clinically validated<\/li>\n    <li><strong>Fast-acting<\/strong> in as little as 10 minutes<\/li>\n    <li><strong>Founded by J&amp;J executives<\/strong> with 30+ patents<\/li>\n    <li><strong>SmartSorb™ technology<\/strong> — patented water-soluble delivery<\/li>\n    <li><strong>Low minimum order<\/strong> — start with a single case<\/li>\n    <li><strong>THC-free<\/strong>, vegan, non-GMO, made in the USA<\/li>\n    <li><strong>50% retail margin<\/strong> on every unit<\/li>\n    <li><strong>FDA-inspected<\/strong>, GMP-certified manufacturing<\/li>\n    <li><strong>Easy reordering<\/strong> through your wholesale portal<\/li>\n    <li><strong>POS &amp; marketing materials<\/strong> included at no cost<\/li>\n  <\/ul>\n<\/div>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["diff_html_wl3"],"settings":{"id":"diff-wl3","full_width":true,"space_around":false,"margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"padding_around":true,"padding_top":70,"padding_bottom":70,"background":"#001029","heading_color":"#efec9f","text_color":"#ffffff"}},"apply_cta_1_wl3":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"apply1_html_wl3":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n  <a href=\"https:\/\/af.uppromote.com\/nextevo-naturals\/register\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#001029;color:#efec9f;font-size:15px;font-weight:900;padding:17px 52px;border-radius:2px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;\">Apply Now<\/a>\n<\/div>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["apply1_html_wl3"],"settings":{"id":"apply-cta