te — City, State]<\/span><\/div>\n    <div class=\"wl3-testi-card\"><span class=\"tq\">&ldquo;<\/span><p>After 6 years running our facility, it's rare to find a supplement company that actually puts operators first. Low MOQ, fast shipping, and our members can feel it working. That last part is what keeps them buying.<\/p><span class=\"ta\">[Gym Owner Name]<\/span><span class=\"tg\">[Boutique Fitness Studio — City, State]<\/span><\/div>\n    <div class=\"wl3-testi-card\"><span class=\"tq\">&ldquo;<\/span><p>The science behind NextEvo is what sold me. When I can hand a member a product and explain 6x absorption and 10-minute onset and show them a clinical study — that's a conversation that closes itself. Our monthly reorder hasn't missed since we started.<\/p><span class=\"ta\">[Clinic Owner Name]<\/span><span class=\"tg\">[Recovery &amp; PT Clinic — City, State]<\/span><\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["testi_html_wl3"],"settings":{"id":"testimonials-wl3","full_width":false,"space_around":true,"margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"padding_around":true,"padding_top":70,"padding_bottom":70,"background":"#ffffff","heading_color":"#001029","text_color":"#333333"}},"economics_wl3":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"econ_html_wl3":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<style>\n.wl3-econ{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}\n.wl3-econ h2{font-size:clamp(20px,2.8vw,30px);font-weight:900;color:#001029;margin:0 0 8px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;}\n.wl3-econ p.sub{font-size:15px;color:#555;margin:0 0 32px;}\n.wl3-econ-rows{border:1.5px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:20px;}\n.wl3-econ-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;}\n.wl3-econ-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;background:#001029;}\n.wl3-econ-row .er-label{font-size:14px;color:#666;font-weight:600;}\n.wl3-econ-row .er-val{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#001029;}\n.wl3-econ-row:last-child .er-label{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);}\n.wl3-econ-row:last-child .er-val{color:#efec9f;font-size:22px;}\n.wl3-econ-note{font-size:12px;color:#999;}\n<\/style>\n<div class=\"wl3-econ\">\n  <h2>The Numbers<\/h2>\n  <p class=\"sub\">Your margins, your call. No guesswork.<\/p>\n  <div class=\"wl3-econ-rows\">\n    <div class=\"wl3-econ-row\"><span class=\"er-label\">Wholesale Unit Cost<\/span><span class=\"er-val\">$27.50<\/span><\/div>\n    <div class=\"wl3-econ-row\"><span class=\"er-label\">MSRP<\/span><span class=\"er-val\">$55.00<\/span><\/div>\n    <div class=\"wl3-econ-row\"><span class=\"er-label\">Units per Case<\/span><span class=\"er-val\">12<\/span><\/div>\n    <div class=\"wl3-econ-row\"><span class=\"er-label\">Case Cost<\/span><span class=\"er-val\">$330<\/span><\/div>\n    <div class=\"wl3-econ-row\"><span class=\"er-label\">Revenue per Case at MSRP<\/span><span class=\"er-val\">$660<\/span><\/div>\n    <div class=\"wl3-econ-row\"><span class=\"er-label\">Your Gross Profit per Case<\/span><span class=\"er-val\">$330 — 50% margin<\/span><\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <p class=\"wl3-econ-note\">POS displays and marketing materials included with every wholesale order at no additional cost.<\/p>\n<\/div>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["econ_html_wl3"],"settings":{"id":"economics-wl3","full_width":false,"space_around":true,"margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"padding_around":true,"padding_top":70,"padding_bottom":70,"background":"#f8fafc","heading_color":"#001029","text_color":"#333333"}},"welcome_kit_wl3":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"kit_html_wl3":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<style>\n.wl3-kit{text-align:center;max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}\n.wl3-kit .kit-tag{display:inline-block;background:#efec9f;color:#001029;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:16px;}\n.wl3-kit h2{font-