rgins?","text":"<p>50% on every unit. Wholesale cost is $27.50 per unit against a $55 MSRP. A single case at MSRP returns $660 in revenue on a $330 investment — $330 gross profit per case.<\/p>"}},"faq3_q5":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Do you offer free shipping?","text":"<p>Contact your partner specialist for current shipping terms and timelines. We work to get product to your facility quickly and reliably. Reach us at hello@nextevo.com or (888) 676-2711.<\/p>"}},"faq3_q6":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Are the products THC-free?","text":"<p>Yes — 100% THC-free, independently third-party lab tested, and fully compliant with federal and state law. Certificates of Analysis are available for every SKU. No concerns about your members' drug testing.<\/p>"}},"faq3_q7":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Can I try the products before placing a wholesale order?","text":"<p>Yes. Contact hello@nextevo.com to ask about our sample program for qualified wholesale applicants.<\/p>"}},"faq3_q8":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What sell-through support do you provide?","text":"<p>Every wholesale partner receives a welcome kit with POS displays, product testers, and printed marketing materials. Your partner specialist is available to help you launch and grow your NextEvo section.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["faq3_q1","faq3_q2","faq3_q3","faq3_q4","faq3_q5","faq3_q6","faq3_q7","faq3_q8"],"name":"FAQ","settings":{"spacing":true,"margin_top":0,"margin_bottom":0,"title":"FAQs","background":"#ffffff","text_color":"#002d72"}},"final_cta_wl3":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"final_html_wl3":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<style>\n.wl3-final{text-align:center;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}\n.wl3-final h2{font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,42px);font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 16px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-0.3px;}\n.wl3-final p{font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.72);line-height:1.65;margin:0 0 36px;m